<title>UK: BAA NAMES MIKE ROBERTS TECHNICAL DIRECTOR.</title>
<headline>BAA NAMES MIKE ROBERTS TECHNICAL DIRECTOR.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British airports operator BAA Plc said on Thursday that it has appointed Mike Roberts, currently managing director, as group technical director.</p>
<p>Roberts takes over the role from Michael Maine on  November 1, 1997. Maine is due to retire at the end of the Terminal 5 inquiry expected in June 1998.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
